            "jpName": "スペシャルウィーク",
            "enName": "Special Week",
            "jpText": "『大和撫子、見参ですっ！\r\n不退転レスラー、ぐらぁ～すわんだぁー！』",
            "enText": "<i>In this corner is the ideal of Japanese \nbeauty and might! The unwavering wrestler, \nGraaaass Wonderrr!</i>",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 594734589695378303,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エルコンドルパサー",
            "enName": "El Condor Pasa",
            "jpText": "ケ！？　スぺちゃん！？\r\n……悪いもの食べましたデスか？",
            "enText": "¡¿Qué?! Spe, did you eat something funny?",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -2056733139054494606,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "グラスワンダー",
            "enName": "Grass Wonder",
            "jpText": "ふふふ……\r\n『どさん子ウマ娘の意地、見せますっ！\nど根性レスラー、スペシャ～ル、ウィ～ク！』",
            "enText": "Hehe… <i>And in this corner, she'll show you \nthat Hokkaido spirit! It's the wrestler with \nguts of steel, Speciaaaal Weeek!</i>",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -4293170823563610507,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エルコンドルパサー",
            "enName": "El Condor Pasa",
            "jpText": "…………！！\r\nフッ……フッフッフ、アーッハッハッハ！",
            "enText": "……!! …Heh… hehehe… AHAHAHA!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 8750443030897659508,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エルコンドルパサー",
            "enName": "El Condor Pasa",
            "jpText": "ここに登場！　ただいま参上！\r\n世界最強、疾風怒濤、電光石火の\n覆面レスラー！",
            "enText": "And finally, she's here! The one to fear! The \nworld's strongest! The raging tempest, the \nlightspeed storm of a masked wrestler!",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -1865209032931049131,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エルコンドルパサー",
            "enName": "El Condor Pasa",
            "jpText": "その名もっ！！",
            "enText": "Her name?",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 4735981600734300408,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "2人",
            "enName": "Both",
            "jpText": "ハッピーバースデー、エルコンドルパサー！",
            "enText": "Happy birthday, El Condor Pasa!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 3866685563832406666,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エルコンドルパサー",
            "enName": "El Condor Pasa",
            "jpText": "……！！　くううぅ～！！\r\nありがとうございますデェェェース！！",
            "enText": "Ohhh, thank you so muuuch!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -335419372977949748,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スペシャルウィーク",
            "enName": "Special Week",
            "jpText": "おめでとうございます、エルちゃんっ！\r\nカフェテリアでパーティーの準備できてるよ！",
            "enText": "Time to celebrate, El! We've got a party \nall set up for you in the cafeteria!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 5972169259372258086,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "グラスワンダー",
            "enName": "Grass Wonder",
            "jpText": "セイちゃんやキングちゃんも、\r\nお先に行って待ってますよ～。",
            "enText": "Sei and King are already waiting for us there.",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 2098698817196174354,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エルコンドルパサー",
            "enName": "El Condor Pasa",
            "jpText": "行きます行きます、すぐ行きますデース！",
            "enText": "Let's go, let's go! Let's go right nooow!",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": -6561710467951219208,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エルコンドルパサー",
            "enName": "El Condor Pasa",
            "jpText": "……今日は、今日だけは、ホロリくらいなら。\r\nマスクのエルでも、泣いていいことにします。",
            "enText": "…Today, just for today, I think I can let \na couple tears slide while the mask is on.",
